### 2. Upload a Cloudinary
```javascript
// Subir a CDN en lugar de Base64
const uploadToCloudinary = async (file) => {
  const formData = new FormData();
  formData.append('file', file);
  formData.append('upload_preset', 'tu_preset');
  
