| Edge           | ❌ Scrollea  | 🟡 70%   | 🟢 85%  | 🟢 93%   | ✅ **100%**                            |
| Mobile Safari  | ❌ Scrollea  | 🟡 40%   | 🟢 70%  | 🟢 80%   | ✅ **99%**                             |
| Mobile Chrome  | ❌ Scrollea  | 🟡 55%   | 🟢 80%  | 🟢 88%   | ✅ **100%**                            |

